[h1]Shape Projector[/h1]

This mod adds a building that allows you to project shapes into the world that aid in constructing bases in those shapes.

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sgt-Imalas/Sgt_Imalas-Oni-Mods/refs/heads/master/Compat_All.png[/img]

[h1]Current latest Version: 1.0.0[/h1]

[hr][/hr]

[h1]Features[/h1]
[list][*] New Building: Shape Plan Projector, found under Utilities/Structural.
[*] Requires 100KG of raw metal.
[*] Unlocked with the research "Interior Decor".
[*] Each projector can be configured to a different projection color, default is white
[*] Each projector can project multiple shapes that can be configured independently
[*] Shapes included:[list]
	[*] Circle
	[*] Diamond
	[*] Hexagon
	[*] Octagon
	[*] Square
	[*] Triangle[/list]
[*] Configurable Parameters of each shape:[list]
	[*] Origin Position
	[*] Dimensions
	[*] Rotation (in 90° steps, only matters for hexagon and triangle)
	[*] Thick Lines
	[*] Projection active[/list]
[/list]

[hr][/hr]
